title: no signs or other things that block the view, except
pid: ae03c7af-7a8b-480a-8180-64b8bb7104d1
body: |2-
  - A 7-inch square on the lower corner of the passenger’s side windshield
    or the lower corner of the rear window.
  - A 5-inch square on the lower corner of the driver’s side window.
  - A 5-inch square located in the center uppermost portion of your windshield
    for an electronic toll payment device.
  - On the side windows behind the driver.
